# Generated by XcodeGen — regenerate with `xcodegen generate`, never commit.
# The plists/entitlements are written from project.yml's info/entitlements properties.
*.xcodeproj
App/Info.plist
App/Ballast.entitlements
Widgets/Info.plist
Widgets/BallastWidgets.entitlements

# Build products / caches
DerivedData/
# S48: device runs use `-derivedDataPath build/DerivedData` (the documented
# device-install path), so the whole `build/` tree is a local artifact too.
build/
.build/
.spm-packages/
Results/
*.xcresult

# Xcode user state
xcuserdata/

# macOS noise
.DS_Store

# Operator-local checklist — deliberately untracked (accidentally committed once as
# 5eba607; removed from the index in Session 08, ignored ever since)
OPERATOR-TODO.md

# fastlane transient output
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/README.md

# Secrets — NEVER commit. Mirrors the GitHub Actions secrets/variables.
secret.yml
secrets.yml
*.p8
AuthKey_*.p8
*-secrets.md

# CodeGraph index — machine-local, never committed
.codegraph/

# uipro (UI/UX Pro Max) skill files — machine-local design tooling installed by
# `uipro init -a claude` (operator-expected §9, resolved Session 32); third-party
# generated assets, re-installable, never committed (the .codegraph precedent).
.claude/skills/

# S49 — build/CI logs are never build inputs. `ci-mirror-full.log` (1778 lines of
# another machine's xcodebuild output, leaking its absolute paths and username)
# was committed in 152890b and, being unignored by CI's paths-ignore, triggered a
# full billed macOS run. Ignored here AND added to paths-ignore in ci.yml.
*.log

# Python bytecode from the CI helper scripts (scripts/*.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
